professional-skill-piloting-level-0 = Read navigation consoles; controls are unavailable.
professional-skill-piloting-level-1 = Pilot the ship in Drive mode. Brake, Stop and Cruise modes are unavailable.
professional-skill-piloting-level-2 = Full controls, braking and all movement modes.
professional-skill-piloting-level-3 = Full controls; an 80% chance to avoid collision consequences.
professional-skill-shooting-level-0 = Toy and flare guns, mail launcher, spray nozzle, magic staves and PKAs. Available weapons have +5° spread and a 10% chance to fire in a random direction.
professional-skill-shooting-level-1 = Pistols, revolvers, stun guns, ordinary lasers, laser repeater, energy SMGs, handmade and flintlock pistols. +5° spread and 10% random-direction fire chance remain. Lower-tier weapons have no penalties.
professional-skill-shooting-level-2 = All other firearms except light machine guns and grenade launchers. +5° spread and 10% random-direction fire chance. Lower-tier weapons have no penalties.
professional-skill-shooting-level-3 = Light machine guns and grenade launchers. No random-direction shots; extra spread applies only where specified by weapon balance. Lower-tier weapons have no penalties.
professional-skills-gunnery-required = Shooting level 2 is required to control weapons. You can still view the console.
professional-skill-medicine-level-0 = Ointment, bandages, blood packs and basic first aid. Medipen injections take 3 seconds, including self-injection.
professional-skill-medicine-level-1 = Medipens without the skill delay, syringes, health analyzers, basic treatments and simple chemicals. Chemical dispenser use is available.
professional-skill-medicine-level-2 = Hyposprays, ChemMaster, reagent identification and basic surgery: incisions, disinfection, sutures, glass removal, amputations and organ work. Treatments heal 15% more.
professional-skill-medicine-level-3 = Advanced surgery and medical procedures, plus cloning. Treatments apply 15% faster; surgical contamination is reduced by 15%.
professional-skill-engineering-level-0 = Basic tools are available to everyone, but simple engineering actions take longer. Refilling tanks and jetpacks requires no skill.
professional-skill-engineering-level-1 = Advanced tools, door hacking, AME controls and refueling, and regular construction.
professional-skill-engineering-level-2 = RCDs, advanced atmospherics, Tesla, singularity, containment fields, emitters and particle accelerators.
professional-skill-salvage-level-0 = Pickaxe, ore bag and civilian ore reclaimer. Basic salvage actions are available; grappling guns retain a chance to misfire.
professional-skill-salvage-level-1 = Ordinary and diamond drills, mineral scanners, ore crates and grappling guns without penalties.
professional-skill-salvage-level-2 = Crushers, industrial ore reclaimer and piloting the Clarke mech.
professional-skill-botany-level-0 = Inspect plants and harvest ripe crops without a skill. Planting, care and gardening tools require level 1.
professional-skill-botany-level-1 = Planting, watering, fertilizers and gardening tools.
professional-skill-botany-level-2 = Plant analyzers, seed extractors, mutagens and other advanced breeding tools.
professional-skill-cooking-level-0 = Consume food and drinks. Donk-Pockets can be microwaved without a skill.
professional-skill-cooking-level-1 = Microwave, oven and assembler recipes with 1-2 ingredient types. Simple drinks and coffee.
professional-skill-cooking-level-2 = All recipes, including complex dishes and drinks.
professional-skill-science-level-0 = The research console and R&D server are available: research technologies and insert disks without a skill.
professional-skill-science-level-1 = Artifact analysis, scanning and activation.
professional-skill-science-level-2 = Anomaly work, including the scanner, M.A.R.T.Y.Kh particle emitter and generator.
professional-skills-unknown-reagent = Unknown substance
professional-skills-botany-failure = You failed to tend the plant correctly.
